{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After you Cast an {c_important}Ultimate{/c} Skill, lob {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} bombs that deal {c_random}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Fire damage. Gain {c_number}[{SF_13}*100|%|]{/c} Cooldown Reduction.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Killing an enemy with your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power reduces your {c_important}Ultimate{/c} Skill's Cooldown by {c_random}[{SF_9}|2|]{/c} |4second:seconds;.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
